B.aqg=s(["Peanuts (groundnuts)","Maize (corn)","Cottonseed","Dried red chillies / spices"],t.s)
B.a3k=s(["Inspect peanuts and grains: discard any nuts that are discolored, moldy, shriveled, or bitter tasting.","Store grains, pulses, and nuts in airtight dry containers away from humidity and warmth.","Ensure proper dry roasting: thermal roasting reduces aflatoxin concentrations by 30-45%."],t.s)
B.SU=new A.n3("haz_aflatoxins","Aflatoxin B1 (Mycotoxin)",B.o1,"Potent hepatocarcinogen, acting synergistically with Hepatitis B viral infection to increase hepatocellular carcinoma risk in tropical developing nations.","Commercially certified packaged nuts undergo strict optical sorting and aflatoxin testing, making risk very low. The primary risk comes from uninspected, moldy, or visibly spoiled street commodities.",B.a3k)
B.aq9=new A.Hb(3,"processingContaminant")
B.U2=new A.VG(1,"group2A")
B.aqn=s(["Fried potato chips","French fries","Toasted bread / biscuits","Roasted coffee"],t.s)
B.a3S=s(["Soak cut raw potatoes in water for 15-30 minutes before frying to leach surface reducing sugars (reduces acrylamide by 40-50%).","Aim for a golden-yellow hue rather than dark brown or blackened crusts when toasting bread or frying.",'Never store raw potatoes in the refrigerator (below 6\xb0C), as cold temperatures trigger "cold-induced sweetening", spiking reducing sugar levels.',"Boiling or steaming potatoes produces zero acrylamide because temperatures cannot exceed 100\xb0C in water."],t.s)
B.SV=new A.n3("haz_acrylamide","Acrylamide (Thermal Processing Contaminant)",B.U2,"Extensive prospective cohort studies in human populations show inconsistent associations between dietary acrylamide and human cancer incidence, contrasting with high-dose animal bioassays. Consequently, IARC maintains Group 2A (Probably Carcinogenic to humans).","Consuming golden-brown fried foods occasionally contributes minimal absolute lifetime cancer risk. The primary risk occurs with chronic consumption of heavily charred or burnt starchy foods. Avoiding deep dark browning is an effective, non-fear-driven mitigation.",B.a3S)
B.aq8=new A.Hb(1,"heavyMetal")
B.aqd=s(["Paddy rice","Rice bran products","Groundwater in endemic areas (e.g. Bengal Basin)"],t.s)
B.ZT=s(["Rinse rice thoroughly in fresh water 3 to 4 times before cooking.",'Use the "excess water boiling" method: Cook rice in 6 parts water to 1 part rice, and discard the cooking water (removes 40-50% of inorganic arsenic).',"Diversify staple carbohydrates by rotating rice with millets (ragi, foxtail, bajra), wheat, and tubers, which accumulate far less arsenic."],t.s)
B.SW=new A.n3("haz_inorganic_arsenic","Inorganic Arsenic (Heavy Metal Contaminant)",B.o1,"Chronic high-level ingestion in drinking water is definitively causal for skin, bladder, and lung cancers. Dietary rice intake in diverse diets carries substantially lower risk, but remains a focus for pediatric populations.","Normal consumption of varied grains carries low risk. Rinsing and high-water cooking reduces exposure dramatically.",B.ZT)
B.aqu=s(["Charcoal grilled meats","Tandoori meats on open flame","Smoked fish","Reused fried oils"],t.s)
B.a0B=s(["Marinate meats with antioxidant-rich herbs (rosemary, turmeric, garlic, lemon juice) for 30 minutes before grilling; polyphenol antioxidants block HCA formation by up to 90%.","Avoid direct contact between meat and open flames; use indirect heat or place foil under meat to prevent fat dripping onto burning coals.","Pre-cook meat briefly (1-2 minutes) in the microwave and discard the expelled fluid (which contains precursor creatine) before quick finishing on the grill.","Trim all visibly charred or blackened portions before eating."],t.s)
B.SX=new A.n3("haz_hca_pah","Heterocyclic Amines (HCAs) & Polycyclic Aromatic Hydrocarbons (PAHs)",B.o1,"High intake of well-done, charred, and flame-grilled meats is correlated with elevated relative risks of colorectal, prostate, and pancreatic adenomas in prospective epidemiological cohorts.","Eating traditionally grilled food in moderation carries low absolute risk, especially when accompanied by antioxidant-rich vegetables. Simple kitchen preparation modifications block the majority of chemical formation.",B.a0B)
